{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hangar 9\u00ae J-3 Cub 10cc, when equipped with the shorter &quot;clipped&quot; wings is a 67.5\u201d (1.8m) span giant-scale replica of the aviation icon.  It's designed to deliver the original's classic look and flying experience with modern-day features and conveniences, including a 2-piece wing and slots to hold the wing tube in the fuselage during storage and transport.  The ARF version arrives mostly factory assembled and allows you to install a .62 4-stroke glow, 11cc 4-stroke gas, and other similar class engines or an equivalent electric power system and the electronics you prefer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC includes gas and electric versions, with and without floats that allow operation from water.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3483050?t=1758740774","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3483050?t=1758740774","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483050/f0d8f4d3e1fa0cfab7d80e4acf00bd5698bd4179/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758740774","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483050/f0d8f4d3e1fa0cfab7d80e4acf00bd5698bd4179/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758740774","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hangar 9\u00ae J-3 Cub 10cc, when equipped with the s